---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  theme="warm"
  title="Pareno 并言 · Obsidian 与 macOS 写作检查器"
  description="Pareno 把检查、翻译、解释放进 Obsidian 侧栏和 macOS 光标旁。本地优先，支持中文、英文、俄文。"
>
  <section class="hm-hero">
    <div class="wrap hm-hero-grid">
      <div class="hm-copy">
        <span class="eyebrow">PARENO 并言 · OBSIDIAN + MACOS</span>
        <h1>在正文里写，<br /><em>在光标旁判断。</em></h1>
        <p class="hm-lead">
          同一个 Pareno，两个写作入口：Obsidian 里的完整侧栏，和 macOS 上贴着光标的一条 HUD。
          检查、翻译、解释，都先给你理由，再让你决定。
        </p>
        <div class="hm-actions">
          <a class="button primary" href="/desktop">Pareno Desktop <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
          <a class="button" href="/install">Obsidian 插件</a>
        </div>
        <div class="hm-meta">
          <span>本地优先</span><span>中 / EN / RU</span><span>Ollama / 云端</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hm-collage">
        <figure class="hm-shot hm-shot-desktop">
          <img src="/pareno-desktop-shot.webp" alt="Pareno Desktop：光标旁的检查 HUD 与结果卡" width="1500" height="1051" />
          <figcaption>macOS · 贴着光标</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="hm-shot hm-shot-obsidian">
          <img src="/pareno-obsidian-panel.webp" alt="Pareno Obsidian 插件：侧栏中的检查范围、任务与修改结果" width="900" height="1277" />
          <figcaption>Obsidian · 侧栏里</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="hm-section hm-products">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="hm-head">
        <span class="eyebrow">CHOOSE YOUR SURFACE</span>
        <h2>你在哪里写，<br />Pareno 就在哪里。</h2>
        <p>两个版本共享同一套语言：检查、翻译、解释；同一个判断标准，不同的写作表面。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="hm-product-grid">
        <a class="hm-product" href="/desktop">
          <div class="hm-product-media"><img src="/pareno-desktop-shot.webp" alt="Pareno Desktop 产品界面" width="1500" height="1051" loading="lazy" /></div>
          <div class="hm-product-body">
            <span class="hm-tag">macOS · 0.9.6</span>
            <h3>Pareno Desktop</h3>
            <p>在任何 App 里打字或选中文字，HUD 出现在光标旁。不复制、不切换窗口。</p>
            <ul><li>检查 / 翻译 / 解释</li><li>Universal · macOS 13+</li><li>$19.99 买断</li></ul>
            <span class="hm-link">了解 Desktop <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
          </div>
        </a>
        <a class="hm-product" href="/install">
          <div class="hm-product-media hm-portrait"><img src="/pareno-obsidian-panel.webp" alt="Pareno Obsidian 插件侧栏" width="900" height="1277" loading="lazy" /></div>
          <div class="hm-product-body">
            <span class="hm-tag">Obsidian · v0.8.0</span>
            <h3>Pareno for Obsidian</h3>
            <p>在侧栏里做全文审校、双语核对、作者风格和写作对话；每条建议都可编辑。</p>
            <ul><li>正文批注 / 全文审校</li><li>中英核对 / 写作对话</li><li>本地 Ollama / Agent CLI</li></ul>
            <span class="hm-link">安装 Obsidian 版 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="hm-section hm-tasks">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="hm-head hm-head-center">
        <span class="eyebrow">ONE LANGUAGE</span>
        <h2>检查、翻译、解释，<br />不是三套工具。</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="hm-task-grid">
        <article><span>01 / CHECK</span><h3>检查</h3><p>语法、拼写、用词、搭配和不自然表达；区分明确错误与可选润色。</p></article>
        <article><span>02 / TRANSLATE</span><h3>翻译</h3><p>中、英、俄互译，忠实译法与自然表达并列，保留名字、数字和语气。</p></article>
        <article><span>03 / EXPLAIN</span><h3>解释</h3><p>说明为什么不对、更自然的说法和例句，把一次修改变成长期学习。</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="hm-section hm-local">
    <div class="wrap hm-local-grid">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">LOCAL FIRST</span>
        <h2>文字可以<br />完全不离开你的 Mac。</h2>
        <p class="hm-muted">默认连接本机 Ollama。只有你主动选择云端模型或 Agent 时才联网；不收集写作内容，不做分析追踪。</p>
        <ul class="hm-list">
          <li>本地 Ollama：qwen3.5:4b、gemma4:12b 等</li>
          <li>可选 Ollama Cloud 或自带 API</li>
          <li>Obsidian 侧栏与 Desktop HUD 共用同一套任务</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="hm-terminal" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="hm-terminal-bar"><span></span><span></span><span></span><em>pareno — local</em></div>
        <pre><span class="dim">$</span> ollama list
qwen3.5:4b       2.5 GB
gemma4:12b       8.1 GB

<span class="dim">POST</span> localhost:11434/api/chat
<span class="ok">200 OK</span> · no network</pre>
        <div class="hm-terminal-foot"><span class="hm-live"></span> 文字留在你的 Mac 上</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="hm-section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="feedback-band hm-band">
        <span class="eyebrow">FEEDBACK</span>
        <h2>遇到问题，直接说</h2>
        <p>Obsidian 侧栏底部有反馈入口；Desktop 的问题也可以写信到 support@altn.vision。反馈不包含笔记正文、文件路径或密钥。</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button primary" href="/feedback">反馈说明</a>
          <a class="button" href="https://github.com/Jorgut/pareno/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub Issues ↗</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .hm-hero { position: relative; padding: clamp(64px, 9vw, 112px) 0 clamp(54px, 8vw, 92px); overflow: hidden; }
  .hm-hero::before { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: -20% -10% auto -10%; height: 75%; background: radial-gradient(55% 65% at 30% 30%, rgba(216,188,120,.12), transparent 70%); pointer-events: none; }
  .hm-hero-grid { position: relative; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.05fr; gap: clamp(36px, 6vw, 80px); align-items: center; }
  .hm-copy h1 { font-size: clamp(2.9rem, 5vw, 4.2rem); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -.03em; margin: 22px 0; font-weight: 500; }
  .hm-copy h1 em { color: var(--gold-soft); font-style: italic; display: block; white-space: nowrap; }
  .hm-lead { max-width: 31em; color: var(--muted); font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.4vw, 1.12rem); line-height: 1.85; margin: 0 0 28px; }
  .hm-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; }
  .hm-meta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 7px 18px; margin-top: 20px; color: var(--muted); font: .68rem/1.4 ui-monospace, "SF Mono", Menlo, monospace; letter-spacing: .06em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .hm-meta span::before { content: "·"; margin-right: 7px; color: var(--gold); }
  .hm-meta span:first-child::before { content: none; }
  .hm-collage { position: relative; min-height: 470px; }
  .hm-shot { position: absolute; margin: 0; border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; background: #090807; box-shadow: 0 28px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.5); }
  .hm-shot img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
  .hm-shot figcaption { padding: 10px 13px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--gold); font: .62rem ui-monospace, "SF Mono", Menlo, monospace; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .hm-shot-desktop { top: 0; left: 0; width: 88%; z-index: 1; }
  .hm-shot-obsidian { right: 0; bottom: 0; width: 40%; z-index: 2; border-color: rgba(216,188,120,.35); }
  .hm-shot-obsidian img { aspect-ratio: 900 / 1277; object-fit: cover; object-position: top; }
  .hm-section { padding: clamp(64px, 9vw, 112px) 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .hm-head { max-width: 40em; }
  .hm-head h2 { font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4.5vw, 3.6rem); line-height: 1.03; letter-spacing: -.025em; margin: 0 0 18px; font-weight: 500; }
  .hm-head p { color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.85; }
  .hm-head-center { text-align: center; margin: 0 auto 36px; }
  .hm-product-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 18px; margin-top: 36px; }
  .hm-product { display: flex; flex-direction: column; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; background: var(--surface); text-decoration: none; color: inherit; transition: border-color .2s ease, transform .2s ease; }
  .hm-product:hover { border-color: rgba(216,188,120,.45); transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .hm-product-media { height: 270px; overflow: hidden; background: #090807; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .hm-product-media img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: top; }
  .hm-product-media.hm-portrait img { object-position: top center; }
  .hm-product-body { padding: 22px; }
  .hm-tag { display: inline-block; color: var(--gold); font: .62rem ui-monospace, "SF Mono", Menlo, monospace; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .hm-product h3 { font-size: 1.7rem; margin: 8px 0 8px; font-weight: 500; }
  .hm-product p { color: var(--muted); font-size: .9rem; line-height: 1.75; margin: 0 0 12px; }
  .hm-product ul { list-style: none; margin: 0 0 18px; padding: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: .8rem; }
  .hm-product li { padding: 5px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .hm-link { color: var(--gold-soft); font-size: .8rem; }
  .hm-task-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 18px; }
  .hm-task-grid article { padding: 24px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.015); }
  .hm-task-grid span { color: var(--gold); font: .62rem ui-monospace, "SF Mono", Menlo, monospace; letter-spacing: .1em; }
  .hm-task-grid h3 { font-size: 1.45rem; margin: 14px 0 8px; font-weight: 500; }
  .hm-task-grid p { color: var(--muted); font-size: .88rem; line-height: 1.75; margin: 0; }
  .hm-local { background: #12100d; }
  .hm-local-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: clamp(36px, 7vw, 90px); align-items: center; }
  .hm-local h2 { font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4.5vw, 3.4rem); line-height: 1.05; margin: 0 0 18px; font-weight: 500; }
  .hm-muted { color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.85; }
  .hm-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 20px 0 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: .9rem; }
  .hm-list li { padding-left: 18px; margin: 9px 0; position: relative; }
  .hm-list li::before { content: "—"; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--gold); }
  .hm-terminal { border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); border-radius: 14px; overflow: hidden; background: #090807; box-shadow: 0 28px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.35); }
  .hm-terminal-bar { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; padding: 12px 15px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); background: #151310; }
  .hm-terminal-bar span { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: #3b352c; }
  .hm-terminal-bar span:first-child { background: #b68c4e; }
  .hm-terminal-bar em { margin-left: 10px; color: var(--muted); font: .64rem ui-monospace, "SF Mono", Menlo, monospace; font-style: normal; }
  .hm-terminal pre { margin: 0; padding: 24px; border: 0; background: transparent; color: #cfc4b1; font: .78rem/1.95 ui-monospace, "SF Mono", Menlo, monospace; overflow-x: auto; }
  .hm-terminal .dim { color: #746d62; }
  .hm-terminal .ok { color: var(--gold-soft); }
  .hm-terminal-foot { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 14px 24px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--muted); font-size: .72rem; }
  .hm-live { width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: #8fb59a; box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(143,181,154,.1); }
  .hm-band { background: rgba(255,255,255,.02); }
  @media (max-width: 1000px) {
    .hm-hero-grid, .hm-local-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .hm-collage { min-height: 520px; max-width: 760px; }
    .hm-product-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .hm-product-media { height: 300px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .hm-copy h1 { font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 9.6vw, 3.4rem); }
    .hm-copy h1 em { white-space: normal; }
    .hm-actions .button { width: 100%; justify-content: center; }
    .hm-collage { min-height: 390px; }
    .hm-shot-desktop { width: 92%; }
    .hm-shot-obsidian { width: 46%; }
    .hm-task-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .hm-product-media { height: 220px; }
  }
</style>
